      "reason": "The definition admits rideable devices, whereas ru.pedestrian describes persons rather than those devices, so its admitting words reach no member of this class."
    },
    {
      "class": "ru.pedestrian_with_white_cane_or_guide_animal",
      "verdict": "contradicted",
